1
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,730
To be

2
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:29,950
continued...

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,680
rider from Snowborn.
None have come, my lord.

4
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:52,020
Six thousand spears.

5
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,600
Less than half of what I'd hoped for.

6
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:59,180
Six thousand will not be enough
to break the lines of the mortal.

7
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,160
more will come

8
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:09,620
every hour last hastens Gondor's defeat
we have till dawn then we must ride

9
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:39,100
I don't know.
